<title>FINLAND: BIRKA LINE SEES 1997 PROFIT MATCHING 96.</title>
<headline>BIRKA LINE SEES 1997 PROFIT MATCHING 96.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish passenger ferry group Birka Line AB said on Thursday it expected its earnings in 1997 to be on par with the 1996 level, when it reported an over 300 percent surge in profit to 15.7 million markka from 3.6 million.</p>
<p>&quot;The result for 1997 is expected to be level with the 1996 full-year result,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
